// Randomness generator file — conflicts that fit any genre.
// Lines starting with // are comments.
// The FIRST table is what rolls when the file is rolled.
// Each genre file mixes these with its own conflicts (its "Conflict Mix"
// tables), so a Horror seed can roll either a Horror conflict or one of these.
//
// Three lists, one per audience. When you add a conflict, add it to every
// list it suits:
//   Conflicts     — everything (New Adult and Adult)
//   Conflicts YA  — no pregnancy, forced marriage, spouses, impairment or
//                   end-of-life decisions
//   Conflicts MG  — as YA, plus no romance, assault or workplace trouble
// Roll from any note with `rdm:[@Conflicts]`
Title: Conflicts

